    "homeType": "TOWNHOUSE",
    "description": "With extra-tall windows and generous room proportions, the Treetop Townhouse gives a wonderfully airy feeling from the moment you walk up the stairs and into the elegant, fireplace'd living room - which leads directly out to one of the two private terraces - amazing private outdoor space in the center of SF! Through the dining area and into the generous kitchen, the beautiful stainless steel appliances and updated countertops gleam, and provide a wonderful place to cook. Entertaining is easy; chat with your guests as they sit across from you at the oversized kitchen island or on a sofa in the family room area. A swish powder room with new stone and lighting impress, and upstairs on the top level are the bedrooms, both with lovely treetop and city views and en-suite baths. The back bedroom features an outdoor terrace with good separation (both en-suite bathrooms and the laundry room in between). Don't forget the huge bonus living space (with its own private entrance on Portola!) and the generous 2-car tandem garage on the first level. With a fantastic layout, fantastic views, two private decks, wonderful updated kitchen and baths, and an exquisite location, right in the geographic top and center of the city - this three-level townhouse is one you would love to call home!"
  },
